                "text": "I\u2019m running for Governor, because I believe that Virginia needs decisive leadership that puts Virginia first.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m rolling out a straightforward agenda of what I\u2019ll do as Governor to lower costs for Virginians. Read more:\nhttps://t.co/Gl3UmTdIfT",
