                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Quality, affordable healthcare shouldn\u2019t cost an arm and a leg.\n\nThat\u2019s why as Virginia\u2019s next Governor, I\u2019ll lower drug costs by holding large pharmaceutical companies accountable and improving access to quality, affordable medication.",
